WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:02.409
Let's follow a roofing enquiry.

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.310
Start at Home for the week's leads

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.169
and decisions.

00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:09.850
The lead board groups homeowner enquiries
by

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:13.169
priority, with a reason behind each
rating.

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:17.469
In Approvals, read the proposed follow-up
and

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:19.709
check the context before deciding.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:21.770
Approve by email,

00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:23.190
request a change,

00:00:23.549 --> 00:00:24.610
or decline.

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:28.129
This example uses fictional data;

00:00:28.829 --> 00:00:30.149
no message is sent.
